-### DeltaNet conv1d order (A1)
-- **Root cause**: PyTorch Conv1d uses **cross-correlation**, not convolution
-- `weight[:,3]` applied to newest input, `weight[:,0]` to oldest
-- Our implementation had this reversed → signal was 3x weaker
